    <briefdescription>
<para>Provides utility functions to trim whitespace from strings. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This header defines functions to remove leading, trailing, or both leading and trailing whitespace characters from std::string objects. The trimming functions modify the string in-place where applicable or return a trimmed copy. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
